## 🚨 Common Pitfalls to AVOID

### 1. Mixing CSS approaches
❌ **DON'T**:
```html
<style>
  .header { padding: 40px; }
</style>
<div class="header">  <!-- Laravel may override this -->
```

✅ **DO** (for emails):
```html
<div style="padding: 40px;">  <!-- Inline = guaranteed priority -->
```

### 2. Not testing dark mode
❌ **DON'T**: Assume colors work in both modes
✅ **DO**: Test with theme switcher in both modes

### 3. Using color names/hex directly
❌ **DON'T**: `text-blue-500`, `bg-green-600`, `style="color: #10b981"`
✅ **DO**: `text-primary`, `bg-success`, `text-base-content`

### 4. Not using Playwright for visual bugs
❌ **DON'T**: Read HTML code and guess
✅ **DO**: Use Playwright Browser MCP to SEE the actual problem

